                  </div>
                </div>

                <div className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                  <div className="bg-slate-950 p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-rose-900/20 space-y-4">
                    <h4 className="text-sm font-black text-white uppercase tracking-widest">1. Clear Browser Cache</h4>
                    <p className="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-bold">Firefox may be caching the GitHub Auth session. Try a "Private Window" or clear your history for <code className="text-rose-400">aistudio.google.com</code>.</p>
